WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.468 line:0%
And finally, new rule.

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.802 line:0%
As an Ivy League graduate

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.071 line:0%
who knows the value
of a liberal education,

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.840 line:0%
I have one piece of advice
for the youth of America.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.408 line:0%
Don't go to college.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:14.814 line:0%
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS, APPLAUDS)

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.883 line:0%
And if you absolutely
have to go,

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:18.684 line:0%
don't go to an elite college,

00:00:18.784 --> 00:00:20.419 line:0%
because as recent events
have shown,

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.054 line:0%
it just makes you stupid.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:27.927 line:0%
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.764
There are few, if any,
positives to come out
of what happened in Israel.

00:00:31.897 --> 00:00:33.900
But one of them
is opening America's eyes

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.437
to how higher education
has become indoctrination

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.738
into a stew of bad ideas.

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.474
Among them,
the simplistic notion

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.309
that the world is a binary place

00:00:43.409 --> 00:00:46.412
where everyone is either
an oppressor or oppressed.

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.283
In the case of Israel,
oppressors being
babies and bubbes.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:52.218
The same students
who will tell you

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:54.854
that words are violence
and silence is violence

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.755
were very supportive
when Hamas terrorists

00:00:56.855 --> 00:00:59.692
went on a rape and murder
rampage worthy of the Vikings.

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:02.361
They knew where to point
the fingers, at the murdered,

00:01:02.461 --> 00:01:04.464
and then it was off
to ethics class.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:06.866
(CHUCKLING)

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:11.670
-Now--
-(APPLAUSE)

00:01:11.971 --> 00:01:14.273
Now I recognize that a certain
amount of foolishness

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.075
is expected of college kids.

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:18.677
But, mixing Jägermeister
and tomato juice

00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:20.880
isn't the same
as siding with terrorists.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:23.082
(CHUCKLING)

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.985
Thirty-four student groups
at Harvard signed a letter

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:28.921
that said the apartheid regime
is the only one to blame,

00:01:29.054 --> 00:01:31.257
proving they don't know
what constitutes apartheid.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:33.225
They don't know much
of anything, actually.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:36.329
But it doesn't deter them
from having an opinion.

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:37.863
They've convinced themselves

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.366
Israel is the most
repressive regime in history

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:42.168
because they have
no knowledge of history,

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:44.103
or even a desire to know it.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:46.306
And actual history
doesn't come up

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:51.044
in their intersectionality
of politics and gender queer
identities class.

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:57.383
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.187
Now to be fair, at least
five of the student groups

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:02.688
have rescinded what they signed,

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:04.991
saying they didn't
read the letter closely.

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:06.259
(CHUCKLING)

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:08.594
And they promised
not to make that mistake again

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:10.897
after they graduate
and start running the world.

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.299
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:14.033 --> 00:02:17.971
-But--
-(APPLAUSE)

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.306
I actually believe them,

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:22.141
that they didn't read
the letter closely.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.410
I think they scanned it,
said it was blaming Israel,

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.179
and went back to surfing TikTok.

00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:28.147
(CHUCKLING)

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.450
Because college life today
is a day spa

00:02:31.584 --> 00:02:34.620
combined with a North Korean
re-education camp.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.657
To daycare center
with a meal plan,

00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:40.393
except that toddlers
can fire the adults.

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:42.261
The fact that
college presidents,

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:44.496
who usually love
to speak out about anything,

00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:45.831
couldn't find their voice

00:02:45.898 --> 00:02:48.067
to condemn the worst attacks
since the Holocaust

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:52.138
says a lot about who
really controls colleges.

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:55.541
And why,
if ignorance is a disease,

00:02:55.641 --> 00:02:58.010
Harvard Yard
is the Wuhan wet market.

00:02:58.244 --> 00:03:03.349
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:03:07.653 --> 00:03:11.190
It's not that colleges
didn't always have
professors with radical beliefs.

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.159
I know,
I used to sell them weed.

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:19.966
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:24.203
But the reason why
despising Israel

00:03:24.303 --> 00:03:25.971
became pretty much a requirement

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.274
of the American left
is colleges.

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:31.577
Elite colleges,
the mouth of the river,

00:03:31.811 --> 00:03:35.447
from which this and all manner
of radical left, illiberal--

00:03:35.581 --> 00:03:38.885
yes, illiberal, nonsense flows.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:42.521
Supporting all-Black,
that is, segregated dorms,

00:03:42.654 --> 00:03:46.526
segregated
graduation ceremonies
and orientation programs,

00:03:46.826 --> 00:03:49.795
which occur on hundreds
of campuses, is illiberal.

00:03:50.195 --> 00:03:52.865
So is the racism
against Asian applicants,

00:03:53.165 --> 00:03:55.634
and chasing speakers
off of campus.

00:03:55.734 --> 00:03:56.602
(SCOFFS)

00:03:56.769 --> 00:03:58.470
When the First Amendment
watchdog group

00:03:58.604 --> 00:04:01.273
Foundation for Individual
Rights and Expression

00:04:01.373 --> 00:04:03.009
began ranking colleges,

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:05.578
based on their commitment
to free speech and inquiry,

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.414
Harvard came in dead last.

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:12.084
There's only one set of
acceptable opinions on campus,

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.119
and it's policed hard.

00:04:14.653 --> 00:04:16.922
The old dorm room
bull sessions. (CHUCKLES)

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:20.225
It's less risky shooting
the shit in scientology.

00:04:20.559 --> 00:04:25.565
(LAUGHTER, APPLAUSE)

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:31.471
John--
John Stewart Mill wrote that,

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:38.577 line:0%
To which today's
college students respond,

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:40.613 line:0%
