00:04:50.122 --> 00:04:52.892 line:0%
so who cares what
Jon Stewart Mill says,
whoever he is.

00:04:53.026 --> 00:04:53.960 line:0%
(CHUCKLING)

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.229 line:0%
